From e4a3ab74c75d3decc0158747f36026b8e8213d26 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 09:24:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] extensions: add initial AEL infrastructure

Add the initial AMD Event Log (AEL) extension framework.

Introduce the extension layout, entry points, Meson
integration, and documentation required to support
AMD-specific event log enhancements.

Update the build to explicitly include extension sources
and dependencies in phosphor-log-manager. This ensures
extension translation units are retained during linking
and are not removed by toolchain optimizations such as
LTO or dead code elimination.

While existing extensions may not rely on this behavior,
it provides a robust foundation for future extension-based
features and enables the new AEL extension to participate
in the logging framework.

This change is limited to infrastructure and build-system
integration. No functional AEL processing or AMD-specific
runtime enrichment logic is introduced in this commit.

Tested:
  - Build validation

Change-Id: I85b531bbe52b7811fd059422e0c0d4f08f72e940
